{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794251123404,"sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01L7Yh3XrrpSoRfJjXyrzUJC","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && git log --oneline | head; git status; find . -path ./node_modules -prune -o -path ./.git -prune -o -path '*/node_modules' -prune -o -type f -print | head -50; cat README.md Dockerfile"},"output":"6597140 base\nOn branch main\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\n./README.md\n./frontend/package.json\n./frontend/index.html\n./frontend/vite.config.ts\n./frontend/package-lock.json\n./frontend/src/main.tsx\n./frontend/src/App.tsx\n./backend/requirements.txt\n./backend/app.py\n./backend/requirements.lock\n./.dockerignore\n./Dockerfile\n# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\nFROM node:24-slim@sha256:c86ecead9e55a5210ac1727de38a4ca840bf03dcaf34dc9749addbf383b1920c AS frontend\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json* frontend/\nRUN cd frontend \\\n    && if [ -f package-lock.json ]; then npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; else npm install --no-audit --no-fund; fi\nCOPY frontend/ frontend/\nRUN cd frontend && npm run build\n\nFROM python:3.13-slim@sha256:ae14d4ce8771606477a81446e7ef429edd6762305fc50c84507c1041fa8285d1\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \\\n    PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \\\n    PORT=8000\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\nRUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n    else \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n    fi\nCOPY backend/ backend/\nCOPY --from=frontend /app/frontend/dist frontend/dist\nRUN mkdir -p data\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"gunicorn\", \"--bind\", \"0.0.0.0:8000\", \"--pythonpath\", \"backend\", \"app:app\"]\n","metadata":{"output":"6597140 base\nOn branch main\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\n./README.md\n./frontend/package.json\n./frontend/index.html\n./frontend/vite.config.ts\n./frontend/package-lock.json\n./frontend/src/main.tsx\n./frontend/src/App.tsx\n./backend/requirements.txt\n./backend/app.py\n./backend/requirements.lock\n./.dockerignore\n./Dockerfile\n# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\nFROM node:24-slim@sha256:c86ecead9e55a5210ac1727de38a4ca840bf03dcaf34dc9749addbf383b1920c AS frontend\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json* frontend/\nRUN cd frontend \\\n    && if [ -f package-lock.json ]; then npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; else npm install --no-audit --no-fund; fi\nCOPY frontend/ frontend/\nRUN cd frontend && npm run build\n\nFROM python:3.13-slim@sha256:ae14d4ce8771606477a81446e7ef429edd6762305fc50c84507c1041fa8285d1\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \\\n    PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \\\n    PORT=8000\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\nRUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n    else \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n    fi\nCOPY backend/ backend/\nCOPY --from=frontend /app/frontend/dist frontend/dist\nRUN mkdir -p data\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"gunicorn\", \"--bind\", \"0.0.0.0:8000\", \"--pythonpath\", \"backend\", \"app:app\"]\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && git log --oneline | head; git status; find . -path ./node_modules -prune -o -path ./.git -prune -o -path '*/node_modules' -prune -o -type f -print | head -50; cat README.md Dockerfile","time":{"start":1794251122983,"end":1794251123259}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1b36917001Q4COiYGS25BeNj","sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","messageID":"msg_1c1b355d70011r4m2JXOo2Mk6c"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794251123406,"sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01L2rcB2osUmJaMUwNcZXGxd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && cat backend/app.py backend/requirements.txt frontend/package.json frontend/vite.config.ts frontend/index.html frontend/src/*.tsx frontend/src/*.css; cat .dockerignore .gitignore 2>/dev/null; ls frontend; python3 --version; node --version"},"output":"\"\"\"Flask entry point.\"\"\"\n\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom flask import Flask\nfrom flask import send_from_directory\n\nDIST = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"frontend\" / \"dist\"\n\napp = Flask(__name__, static_folder=None)\n\n\n@app.get(\"/api/health\")\ndef health():\n    return {\"status\": \"ok\"}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/\")\n@app.get(\"/<path:path>\")\ndef frontend(path: str = \"index.html\"):\n    if (DIST / path).is_file():\n        return send_from_directory(DIST, path)\n    return send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")\nflask==3.1.3\ngunicorn==26.2.0\n{\n  \"name\": \"app-frontend\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"19.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"19.3.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"6.2.1\",\n    \"vite\": \"8.3.5\"\n  }\n}\nimport react from \"@vitejs/plugin-react\";\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [react()],\n  server: { proxy: { \"/api\": \"http://localhost:8000\" } },\n});\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>App</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\nexport default function App() {\n  return <h1>App</h1>;\n}\nimport { createRoot } from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(<App />);\n**/node_modules\n**/.venv\n**/venv\n**/__pycache__\n**/*.pyc\n**/.git\nfrontend/dist\ndata/*.db\ndata/*.sqlite\ndata/*.sqlite3\nindex.html\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nsrc\nvite.config.ts\nPython 3.13.5\nv24.22.1\ncat: 'frontend/src/*.css': No such file or directory\n","metadata":{"output":"\"\"\"Flask entry point.\"\"\"\n\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom flask import Flask\nfrom flask import send_from_directory\n\nDIST = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"frontend\" / \"dist\"\n\napp = Flask(__name__, static_folder=None)\n\n\n@app.get(\"/api/health\")\ndef health():\n    return {\"status\": \"ok\"}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/\")\n@app.get(\"/<path:path>\")\ndef frontend(path: str = \"index.html\"):\n    if (DIST / path).is_file():\n        return send_from_directory(DIST, path)\n    return send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")\nflask==3.1.3\ngunicorn==26.2.0\n{\n  \"name\": \"app-frontend\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"19.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"19.3.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"6.2.1\",\n    \"vite\": \"8.3.5\"\n  }\n}\nimport react from \"@vitejs/plugin-react\";\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [react()],\n  server: { proxy: { \"/api\": \"http://localhost:8000\" } },\n});\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>App</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\nexport default function App() {\n  return <h1>App</h1>;\n}\nimport { createRoot } from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport App from \"./App\";\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(<App />);\n**/node_modules\n**/.venv\n**/venv\n**/__pycache__\n**/*.pyc\n**/.git\nfrontend/dist\ndata/*.db\ndata/*.sqlite\ndata/*.sqlite3\nindex.html\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nsrc\nvite.config.ts\nPython 3.13.5\nv24.22.1\ncat: 'frontend/src/*.css': No such file or directory\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && cat backend/app.py backend/requirements.txt frontend/package.json frontend/vite.config.ts frontend/index.html frontend/src/*.tsx frontend/src/*.css; cat .dockerignore .gitignore 2>/dev/null; ls frontend; python3 --version; node --version","time":{"start":1794251123002,"end":1794251123314}},"id":"prt_1c1b3692b001wAewbId1DDsr1U","sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","messageID":"msg_1c1b355d70011r4m2JXOo2Mk6c"}}
