iver\", \"Lungs\", \"Kidney\", \"Heart\", \"D\"),\n    (\"What is the main language spoken in Brazil?\", \"Spanish\", \"Portuguese\", \"French\", \"English\", \"B\"),\n    (\"Which element has the atomic number 1?\", \"Helium\", \"Oxygen\", \"Hydrogen\", \"Carbon\", \"C\"),\n    (\"What is the largest mammal in the world?\", \"African elephant\", \"Blue whale\", \"Giraffe\", \"Sperm whale\", \"B\"),\n    (\"Which instrument has 88 keys in its standard form?\", \"Organ\", \"Harpsichord\", \"Piano\", \"Accordion\", \"C\"),\n    (\"What is the currency of Japan?\", \"Yuan\", \"Won\", \"Yen\", \"Ringgit\", \"C\"),\n    (\"Who developed the theory of general relativity?\", \"Isaac Newton\", \"Albert Einstein\", \"Niels Bohr\", \"Galileo Galilei\", \"B\"),\n    (\"What is the tallest mountain above sea level?\", \"K2\", \"Kangchenjunga\", \"Mount Everest\", \"Lhotse\", \"C\"),\n    (\"How many minutes are there in a full day?\", \"1,440\", \"1,200\", \"2,400\", \"1,000\", \"A\"),\n    (\"Which desert is the largest hot desert in the world?\", \"Gobi\", \"Kalahari\", \"Sahara\", \"Arabian\", \"C\"),\n]\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/backend/seed.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"backend/seed.py","time":{"start":1794251258644,"end":1794251258662}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1b57b0a001ZjPm24Hwo2o5UA","sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","messageID":"msg_1c1b4f0c60018ziXmyPdlRPrbf"}}
