{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794251521110,"sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","part":{"id":"prt_1c1b97c480014XzbChmpJ6H073","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c1b96488001KjONTM4pLaleT8","sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":52964,"input":2,"output":474,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"write":789,"read":51699}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794251531568,"sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","part":{"id":"prt_1c1b9a50f00171Nhr4q1OQaDmM","messageID":"msg_1c1b97c51001CGrcZQOEC4Fwup","sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794251531568,"sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","part":{"id":"prt_1c1b9a512001yO7RWBE6XsHdaA","messageID":"msg_1c1b97c51001CGrcZQOEC4Fwup","sessionID":"ses_e3e4cb0caffeC8RwpFdzVuR8Pn","type":"text","text":"I've built the quiz app on top of the starter project. It's not tested end to end: I couldn't build or run the Docker image here because Docker isn't available. I ran the backend locally with gunicorn and checked the API with curl. Registering, signing in, drawing a quiz, submitting with and without a token, listing and opening attempts, the admin question form and paged list, and the 401/403/404 errors all worked. The frontend passes the TypeScript check and `npm run build`, but I didn't click through it in a browser.\n\n**Behaviour you might not assume:**\n- **Quiz size:** `count` defaults to 5. Values above 50 are capped at 50, and 0 or non-numbers get a 400 error.\n- **Submitting:** visitors get their score back with status 200 and `id` set to null. Signed-in users get 201 and the attempt is saved. Each saved attempt keeps a copy of the questions as they were, so its review stays the same if a question changes later.\n- **Admin:** you can't register a user called `admin`. The admin password is set from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` each time the app starts. Changing it signs out old admin sessions; leaving it unset or empty blocks admin sign-in and rejects admin tokens.\n- **Sign-in tokens:** they last 30 days.\n- **Validation errors:** these come back as `{\"error\": ..., \"errors\": {field: message}}`. The Add question form shows each message next to its field.\n- **Extra endpoints:** I added `GET /api/auth/me` and `POST /api/auth/logout`, which the frontend uses to restore and end a session.\n\nThe database starts with 25 general-knowledge questions (in `backend/seed.py`) and is stored at `data/app.db`.\n\n**Changes outside the app code:**\n- **`Dockerfile`:** the local pip install failed using `requirements.lock` as a constraints file, because the lock has hashes and `requirements.txt` doesn't. I added a fallback that installs from the lock file directly if that step fails.\n- **Frontend packages:** I added Tailwind, TypeScript and the React type definitions, and updated `package-lock.json` to match. `npm run typecheck` runs the type check.\n- **Other files:** I added a `.gitignore`, added the database's temporary files to `.dockerignore`, and created a local `.venv/` in the workspace for testing (it's git-ignored).","time":{"start":1794251531538,"end":1794251531542}}}
